        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-ferreira-69041367" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="3"/><path d="M7 10v7M7 7v.01M12 17v-4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v4M12 10v7"/></svg>
